  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Irregular Migration and Protecting the Rights and Wellbeing of Migrants and Refugees in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will implement a 15-month project that will: (i) support and protect people&#x2019;s livelihoods to reduce the socio-economic drivers of irregular migration among Lebanese and Syrian refugee communities; (ii) promote effective border and maritime migration management, including search and rescue services, to avoid loss of life at sea and safeguard the rights of refugees and migrants; and (iii) provide return and reintegration assistance to vulnerable migrants stranded in Lebanon as a result of the crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
